# Background removal for the MVP portrait.
#
# Set this and the "Uploaded photo -> Auto-treat" toggle will cut the background
# out of a photo on upload, as well as desaturating it and framing it to the
# chest. Copy this file to .env.local and fill the key in.
#
# NOTE ON WHERE THE PHOTO GOES: with this set, each uploaded portrait is sent to
# remove.bg, a third-party service, and is billed per image. Leave it unset and
# nothing is uploaded anywhere — the greyscale and the chest framing still run
# locally, and the panel reports that the background was left in place.
REMOVE_BG_API_KEY=
